        "text_preview": "For ready reference Section 77 of the aforesaid Act is reproduced herein as under:-\n\"77."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "537257da2dc14bf08ac2d881fe2b6eba_22",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Time limit for prosecution.-Notwithstanding anything contained in this Act"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f827dec0fb83437681fba6fd80e51b40_23",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": ", no court shall take cognizance of an offence under this Act after the expiry of the period of one year from the date of commission of an offence:\nProvided that the Commissioner of Food Safety may, for reasons to be recorded in writing, ap"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8859fd652c214700bfb811dbf765b8db_24",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "As per the proviso, the Commissioner of Food Safety may for the reasons to be recorded in writing,\napprove prosecution within an extended period upto three years."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0d25c80d8af947a09c88a1d34e92cb1f_26",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The date of commission of offence is not to be counted from the date of report of Food Analyst or from the date of sanction of prosecution."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cc4fceecd6c34f4d94ef2b602cf53caa_27",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The object of prescribing the limitation has been clarified by the Hon'ble Apex Court in the case of State of Punjab Vs. Sarwan Singh, AIR, 1981 SC 1054, wherein it was held that in putting a bar of limitation on prosecution was to prevent "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "2965ddb4a0624c53995ae7f2aeebb4db_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Admittedly, the sample was taken on 16.11.2011."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f7eeb09208dd4d499ba0df7e724b24ca_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The first report of Analyst was received on 01.12.2011."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0effc5c3a5c9429e88c30779fe4afc7c_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The complaint could have been filed within one year from the date of taking sample i.e.\n16.11.2011."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "30c317c4e29b44859b46acf9138fce67_31",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Even by the stretch of bonafide explanation, the factum of adulteration came to be noticed by the prosecution on 01.12.2011."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "de70960c9cfc483f8be4b5f7629fb3dd_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "No complaint was filed by the prosecution even with the aid of proviso to Section 77 within a period of one year from the date of report of Analyst i.e.\nRajesh Ahuja vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 20 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http:/"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3b506a82d5df480d9c4eda107298e758_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The prosecution waited even thereafter till 15.03.2013 and filed the complaint accordingly."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "07cf39349d54414191f0769ac5b1fbf8_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Even second report of the analysis done by Central Laboratory under Section 46(4) of the Act was received on 13.04.2012, still no complaint was filed thereafter for more than eight months."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3dac2c45037d414a873805ad3860acab_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The object which this statute seeks to serve is clearly in consonance with the concept of fairness of trial as enshrined under Article 21 of the Constitution of India."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "67440680df434aeeb4db966e442dc5b0_36",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "7. It is therefore, of the utmost importance that any prosecution, whether by the State or by private complaint must abide by the law or take the risk of prosecution failing on the ground of limitation."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "28d27e9f47784a0c93f05623c1efa9d2_37",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "8. In view of the aforesaid facts, no exception can be carved out."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "4dd90e14bb6946cbab6f69e46918421d_38",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The extension granted by the Commissioner of Food Safety, M.P. vide order dated 24.01.2013 is found to be without any reasons."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a9f4dedfa3d44688be21bfed1f57484e_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nThe only reason shown in the aforesaid order is that the report of second sampling was received from the Central Laboratory, Mysore on 13.04.2012, therefore the approval was granted for launching prosecution against the petitioner."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "523e616e902e426f86894c5335f3839c_40",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "9. In my considered opinion, the aforesaid order is nothing but a farce."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "94fac4ff2c0f4c008a85e1c76b66eb57_41",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The prosecution was not prevented from launching prosecution from the date of sampling, particularly when factum of the material being adulterous came to be noticed on first Analyst report on 01.12.2011."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "6443c7fa1fd34592bb4516f1af3ebba9_42",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Opting for second sampling was an act of the petitioner/accused and the respondent was not supposed to wait for the report of second sampling."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0166b975d3a04c308de1ccdd24259f02_43",
