        "text_preview": "The offence being technical has to be appreciated in the light of ratio in the case of State of Punjab Vs. Sarwan Singh (supra) and also in the light of order dated 23.01.2017 passed by the coordinate Bench of this Court in M.Cr.C. No.10677"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "dab2b9c1926246b5980c50c88c517ac0_44",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
